<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-gen> a skos:Concept , ns:GrammarProduction ;
	skos:definition "The gen production of BeatScript's grammar (gen@2 techno seed=42 section=drop part=bass: the seeded generator, called; GEN is gen@2 or a bare gen)."@en ;
